From 39b6905fadd5f21d9ebca07c891bc38a481f708d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guan Xuetao <gxt@pku.edu.cn>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 05:00:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] target/dadao: Add decodetree instruction decoding

Replace hand-written instruction dispatch with QEMU decodetree mechanism.
All 256 M1+excluded_m1 instructions have decodetree patterns with
corresponding trans_* stubs. Blank cells (no pattern matched) trigger
UNDI; trans_* stubs trigger ILLI (except swym = NOP).

Two decodetree formats:
- @main: extracts ha/hb/hc/hd as fields (main table instructions)
- @misc: extracts hb/hc/hd only (MISC sub-table, ha is opcode part)

Pattern mask/value mechanically generated from contracts/opcodes.yaml.
---
